│                                                                    │
│  • Add token usage and cost warning after the streaming loop       │
│    completes.                                                      │
│  • Ask user to confirm to proceed if cost/token is high and        │
│    auto_run is False.                                              │
│  • If user declines, raise an exception or gracefully abort.       │
