│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ### Describe the bug                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The script should show pricing or warn the user about cost being incurred. OpenAI's billing limits don't work so it is easy to exceed your      │
│ budget.                                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Reproduce                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 1. Run with GPT4                                                                                                                                │
