│    (if available, e.g., litellm._current_cost).                    │
│  • If cost has increased enough or the time interval elapsed,      │
│    yield a small usage update message to the user.                 │
│  • Retain the budget error handling as-is.                         │
│                                                                    │
│ No changes are needed to the setup_openai_coding_llm.py, as cost   │
│ and token usage is runtime state available at response time, best  │
